# Test folders mirror lib

Every Dart/Flutter package and app in this repo should place tests under `test/` using the same relative path as the file under `lib/`. Follow `sdk/thawani_ui` as the reference.

## Mapping

`lib/<path>/<name>.dart` → `test/<path>/<name>_test.dart`

```
# ✅ GOOD (thawani_ui)
lib/src/widgets/empty_state.dart  →  test/src/widgets/empty_state_test.dart
lib/src/theme/thawani_theme.dart   →  test/src/theme/thawani_theme_test.dart
lib/src/utils/debouncer.dart       →  test/src/utils/debouncer_test.dart

# ❌ BAD — flattened at test/
lib/src/widgets/empty_state.dart  →  test/empty_state_test.dart
lib/src/mappers/character_mapper.dart → test/character_mapper_test.dart
```

When adding a source file, create or update its test in the mirrored path. When moving or renaming a `lib/` file, move the matching `*_test.dart` with it.

## Do not

- Dump tests into `test/` root when the source lives under `lib/src/...`
- Invent a different folder tree for tests (`test/unit/`, `test/widgets/`, etc.) unless it already exists under `lib/`
- Add tests for barrel files (`lib/<package>.dart`) that only re-export
- Skip the `_test.dart` suffix
